  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ChalkQL.Sources 0.3 adds composite columns for POCO and Akade sources,\n      sovereign-zone catalogue validation, stricter source row-level-security trust,\n      and source compatibility with ChalkQL's corrected numeric semantics.\n\n      Source builders now support Zone(...), catalogues are restricted to one declared\n      sovereign zone, TrustSourceRowLevelSecurity(...) requires explicit security\n      preconditions, and composite columns remain local-only and non-indexable.\n\n      Requires exactly ChalkQL 0.3.0.\n\n      Full release notes:\n      https://github.com/markhammond/chalkql/releases/tag/v0.3",
